     "cells": [
      {
       "html": "<p>19.30-<br />late</p>"
      },
      {
       "html": "<p align=\"center\"><b><font size=\"+2\">Social Event: Welcome drinks, food and pre-registration</span></b></p>\n\n  <p align=\"center\">\n    <font size=\"+2\">at the <a href=\"http://www.praguebeermuseum.cz/en/\"><b><large>Prague Beer Museum</large></b></a></span><br/>\n    (<a href=\"https://goo.gl/maps/rSdx5pmhGd72\">Smetanovo Nabrezi location</a>, near the Charles Bridge)\n  </p>\n  <p align=\"center\">\n    This is a cash-only pub, credit cards are not accepted. They seem to accept cash in CZK, EUR and USD though.\n  </p>\n  <p align=\"center\">Food and drinks will be available for purchase:</p>\n  <p align=\"center\"><a href=\"http://www.praguebeermuseum.cz/en/content?page=submenu&amp;XUBPAGEHL=2&amp;XUBPAGE=99\">Food menu</a></p>\n  <p align=\"center\"><a href=\"http://www.praguebeermuseum.cz/en/content?page=submenu&amp;XUBPAGEHL=2&amp;XUBPAGE=98\">Drinks menu</a></p>\n  <p align=\"center\">\n    We need to achieve a minimum spend, so if there's anything on the food menu\n    that appeals to you, we'd be grateful if you decided to have dinner there\n    as well.\n  </p>\n  <p align=\"center\">\n    Please order at the table (not at the bar), so that all spending\n    is counted towards us.\n  </p>\n  <p align=\"center\">\n    We have room reserved upstairs. There will be service at the tables.\n  </p>\n  <p>\n  <iframe src=\"https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d2560.0676096856705!2d14.411800750830249!3d50.08502102140876!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x470b94ea75b51be7%3A0x2d7ae400e7b1700!2sPrague+Beer+Museum!5e0!3m2!1sen!2suk!4v1508271551289\" width=\"400\" height=\"300\" frameborder=\"0\" style=\"border:0\" allowfullscreen=\"1\"></iframe>\n  </p>",
       "colspan": 2
